msgid "Improved Qute developer experience"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We are very pleased to announce the 1.13.0 release of Quarkus Tools for "
"IntelliJ.\n"
"This release improves the Qute developer experience."
msgstr ""

msgid "InlayHint support"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"InlayHint is a new feature. It allows to add inline information about "
"parameters and variables. This is very useful for Qute templates to get type "
"information. InlayHints may also be clickable."
msgstr ""

msgid "DocumentHighlight"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"DocumentHightlight allows to hightlight parts of the document that are "
"related to the current selection. This is useful for Qute templates to "
"highlight matching part of a Qute section."
msgstr ""

msgid "Moving Forward"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you have any questions,\n"
"suggestions or feedback, by all means please https://github.com/redhat-"
"developer/intellij-quarkus/issues[open an issue]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Thank you for reading and stay tuned for the next release!"
msgstr ""

